From 83b331f893e24644330354c1bc2cab24903e9005 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: harshanandak <harshanandak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 12:02:59 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat(live): surface go-live errors, clarify sign-in copy,
 confirm clipboard share
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wave 1 P1 operator go-live & share UX (#102):
- LiveBroadcastBar: surface broadcast.error in the go-live branch via
  role="alert" instead of swallowing a failed go-live (the existing
  "Go live & share" button doubles as the retry). Message is generic
  because Convex redacts error messages in production. Add error to the
  broadcast PropTypes shape.
- LiveBroadcastBar: rewrite the signed-out copy to explain the value of
  an account (free to share; matches stay private until you go live).
- ShareLiveMatch: flash "Copied ✓" when a system share silently falls
  back to the clipboard (method === 'clipboard'), via a shared
  flashCopied helper reused by the Copy link button. Real OS shares and
  cancellations stay silent.

Tests: +3 LiveBroadcastBar cases (error surfaced, no-error, account copy),
new ShareLiveMatch.test.jsx (6 cases) covering copy + share/clipboard
confirmation paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
